{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月23日，美國總統特朗普發文：英偉達董事會作出了讓黃仁勳重回行政總裁一職的正確、恰當的決定。國家需要黃仁勳掌舵英偉達，以保障這家公司取得成功、蓬勃發展，同時助力美國經濟走向繁榮。美國政府沒有理由認為黃仁勳回歸英偉達會帶來任何國家安全風險。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587704.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:38:02.041372+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:27:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_hash":"9d9b8261817198433e3193daa1662e04b1756e5e1b08df07dac39836baee1e4e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}